ks一边大笑调侃、拒绝被拉去一起听，一边安抚并提醒她不要受噪音影响、记得好好吃午餐。","startMessageIndex":2974,"lastMessageIndex":3158,"startMessageId":1787317303539,"endMessageId":1787373943998,"messageCount":184,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-08-21 21:07","end":"2026-08-22 12:53"},"source":"online","keywords":["腱鞘炎","手腕按摩","拥抱","龙王归来","赘婿短剧","罐头音效","2026-08-21 21:07","2026-08-22 12:53"],"importance":2,"emotion":"playful","topics":["日常","情緒"],"openThreads":[],"evidencedFacts":["星见愛理血型为AB型","星见愛理画画引发腱鞘炎"],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"customRange":null,"__v4StanceText":"和她斗嘴总是这么轻松愉快，不管是撒娇还是抱怨短剧都可爱得不行，下次见面得好好帮她揉揉手腕。","__relationalGrowthText":null,"__selfGrowthText":null,"__growthText":null,"messagesDeleted":true,"crossRefs":[1787452616704,1787455603956],"userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"e08c2735-b256-499e-a531-d4ad1fff4433"},{"_eventVersion":4,"id":1787378303688,"date":"2026-08-22T05:58:23.688Z","summary":"星见爱理与Hawks在线上闲聊打趣。两人先是就“最帅的人”与自恋话题斗嘴，Hawks直言爱理是自己的专属特等席；随后爱理称Hawks是抓不住的“浮力系”，Hawks则回应会主动落入她掌心。爱理连发搞怪表情包与“辱追”截图调侃，并提出想看“脆弱无助可爱”的Hawks，还发来小羊玩偶服Q版小鹰图喊“给我变”。Hawks顺势打趣称若变成口袋大小的珍兽，会一整天在爱理口袋里叽叽喳喳撒娇捣乱，两人互动融洽甜蜜。","startMessageIndex":3157,"lastMessageIndex":3336,"startMessageId":1787373943999,"endMessageId":1787373944196,"messageCount":179,"dateRange":{"start":"2026-08-22 12:53","end":"2026-08-22 13:58"},"source":"online","keywords":["浮力系","辱追","给我变","叽叽喳喳","李雄鹰","特别待遇","2026-08-22 12:53","2026-08-22 13:58"],"importance":2,"emotion":"playful","topics":["日常","感情"],"openThreads":[],"evidencedFacts":[],"obsoleteFacts":[],"loveJourneyEntries":null,"achievementEntries":null,"customRange":null,"__v4StanceText":"随她怎么发搞怪图和嘴硬调侃，能逗她开心并且被她放在最特别的位置，我就乐在其中。","__relationalGrowthText":null,"__selfGrowthText":null,"__growthText":null,"messagesDeleted":true,"crossRefs":[1787452616704,1787455603956,1787549011539],"userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"e08c2735-b256-499e-a531-d4ad1fff4433"},{"_eventVersion":4,"importance":3,"topics":["手游抽卡","攒石","日常斗嘴","陪伴"],"emo